n- Ember shares your home, always there to play with, care for, or snuggle on the couch after a long day.\n\n{1471237194076810}\n# Endless Ways to Play #\n- You and Ember work as a team to harvest resources, banish thorny weeds, and explore the mysterious Otherlands.\n\n{23905804525715285}\n\n# Collect, Trade, Buy  #\n- Forage resources and trade them in trade for new toys and clothes to suit your Ember\u2019s unique look and personality.\n\n{2661665564036552}\n\n\nStay: Forever Home by the creators of **Bogo** and **First Steps**\n\n\n", "short_description": "Stay: Forever Home is about Ember, a magical creature who comes to live with you. You can play together, go for walks, collect and trade items, and interact with a strange magical world just outside your door."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.windupminds.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.stay-forever-home.com/eula", "publisher_name": "Windup Minds", "support_website_url": "https://www.stay-forever-home.com/support/", "website_url": "https://www.windupminds.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "it", "de", "es", "ko", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25700995619533761"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.